      "description": "A professional 4K auto-tracking PTZ built on a Sony 1/2.8-inch CMOS sensor with a 30x optical zoom (4.5-135mm, F1.8-4.7), delivering UHD up to 60fps over HDMI and 3G-SDI. A built-in AI auto-tracking engine locks onto and smoothly follows a subject hands-free, backed by 255 presets and VISCA, VISCA over IP, Pelco, DVIP and ONVIF control. It pairs a gigabit IP port with NDI|HX3, SRT, RTSP and RTMP(S) streaming and single-cable PoE+ power. It is the base of the PTC-325 series, below the HDBaseT PTC-325T and 12G-SDI PTC-325G.",
